cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "引用本工具集时，请记录你实际使用的具体子工具、版本或 commit，以及相关上游方法的出处。If you use this toolkit, please cite it and record the specific sub-tool, version or commit you used, together with the relevant upstream method references."
title: "linxi / AIforTEM 电镜数据处理工具集"
abstract: "A collection of TEM / HRTEM / STEM / 4D-STEM image-processing, EELS spectroscopy and quantitative-analysis tools, kept as one repository with one directory per tool. 每个工具各有独立的 README、依赖与许可证说明。"
type: software
authors:
